 "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/5ec19ebf784d7f70f99b756b92cf0322.webp?t=1787441402\" width=400 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ランダム生成されたポストアポカリプスの世界を発見します。新しいゲームは、異なるスタートポイントと体験を提供し、放棄された場所や道路でリソースを集め、生存を可能にします。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/6347a380f1801f8d5eeac857896c5f81.poster.avif?t=1787441402\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/6347a380f1801f8d5eeac857896c5f81.webm?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/6347a380f1801f8d5eeac857896c5f81.mp4?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/84f980140c8a99dae4b5984191a9a9e1.webp?t=1787441402\" width=400 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >荒れ果てたRVで旅を始め、各パーツを修理してアップグレードします。ストーブから冷蔵庫、トイレから座席エリアまで、すべてをパーソナライズし、自分だけの生活空間を作り出しましょう。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/2693c389ffde3e9c99151c687fce9ffa.poster.avif?t=1787441402\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/2693c389ffde3e9c99151c687fce9ffa.webm?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/2693c389ffde3e9c99151c687fce9ffa.mp4?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/a8e2a8528cb634ed1dc6c22969a9e4d7.webp?t=1787441402\" width=400 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >料理、釣り、修理、コーヒー作りなどの活動で生き延びましょう。見つけた食べ物を調理するためにRVのキッチンを使用し、より栄養価の高い食事を作りましょう。。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/8dfb0c23d7a324883b9a609c592c0ac7.poster.avif?t=1787441402\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/8dfb0c23d7a324883b9a609c592c0ac7.webm?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/8dfb0c23d7a324883b9a609c592c0ac7.mp4?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/935b6f24dc454b87be2d0fcdc32d55da.webp?t=1787441402\" width=400 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nomad Driveを発見し、その部品はすべて完全にインタラクティブです。家具から家電製品まで、すべてに触れて、カスタマイズして、探索して、RVを本当にあなただけの空間に仕上げましょう！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/a9fca9ebf1f8195bc1498408f3fcae58.poster.avif?t=1787441402\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/a9fca9ebf1f8195bc1498408f3fcae58.webm?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/a9fca9ebf1f8195bc1498408f3fcae58.mp4?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/5d6245e6a1cec17c6967adc08d78b1f1.webp?t=1787441402\" width=400 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nomad Driveの世界で見つけた果物と野菜の種を鉢に植え、世話をして育てましょう。美味しい果物と野菜を実らせてくれます。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/fe854c42012427564b0067286e023c05.poster.avif?t=1787441402\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/fe854c42012427564b0067286e023c05.webm?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/fe854c42012427564b0067286e023c05.mp4?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/1373a1f3a199e0517e53470398014aed.webp?t=1787441402\" width=400 height=40 /></span></p>",
 "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/5ec19ebf784d7f70f99b756b92cf0322.webp?t=1787441402\" width=400 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ランダム生成されたポストアポカリプスの世界を発見します。新しいゲームは、異なるスタートポイントと体験を提供し、放棄された場所や道路でリソースを集め、生存を可能にします。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/6347a380f1801f8d5eeac857896c5f81.poster.avif?t=1787441402\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/6347a380f1801f8d5eeac857896c5f81.webm?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/6347a380f1801f8d5eeac857896c5f81.mp4?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/84f980140c8a99dae4b5984191a9a9e1.webp?t=1787441402\" width=400 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >荒れ果てたRVで旅を始め、各パーツを修理してアップグレードします。ストーブから冷蔵庫、トイレから座席エリアまで、すべてをパーソナライズし、自分だけの生活空間を作り出しましょう。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/2693c389ffde3e9c99151c687fce9ffa.poster.avif?t=1787441402\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/2693c389ffde3e9c99151c687fce9ffa.webm?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/2693c389ffde3e9c99151c687fce9ffa.mp4?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/a8e2a8528cb634ed1dc6c22969a9e4d7.webp?t=1787441402\" width=400 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >料理、釣り、修理、コーヒー作りなどの活動で生き延びましょう。見つけた食べ物を調理するためにRVのキッチンを使用し、より栄養価の高い食事を作りましょう。。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/8dfb0c23d7a324883b9a609c592c0ac7.poster.avif?t=1787441402\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/8dfb0c23d7a324883b9a609c592c0ac7.webm?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/8dfb0c23d7a324883b9a609c592c0ac7.mp4?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/935b6f24dc454b87be2d0fcdc32d55da.webp?t=1787441402\" width=400 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nomad Driveを発見し、その部品はすべて完全にインタラクティブです。家具から家電製品まで、すべてに触れて、カスタマイズして、探索して、RVを本当にあなただけの空間に仕上げましょう！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/a9fca9ebf1f8195bc1498408f3fcae58.poster.avif?t=1787441402\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/a9fca9ebf1f8195bc1498408f3fcae58.webm?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/a9fca9ebf1f8195bc1498408f3fcae58.mp4?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/5d6245e6a1cec17c6967adc08d78b1f1.webp?t=1787441402\" width=400 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nomad Driveの世界で見つけた果物と野菜の種を鉢に植え、世話をして育てましょう。美味しい果物と野菜を実らせてくれます。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/fe854c42012427564b0067286e023c05.poster.avif?t=1787441402\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/fe854c42012427564b0067286e023c05.webm?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/fe854c42012427564b0067286e023c05.mp4?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/1373a1f3a199e0517e53470398014aed.webp?t=1787441402\" width=400 height=40 /></span></p>",
 "short_description": "荒れ果てたRVを修理し、ソロまたは1～4人の協力プレイで、ランダム生成されたポストアポカリプスの世界へ出発しましょう。リソースを集め、RVをカスタマイズし、できるだけ長く生き残りましょう。",
